# Linear MCP contracts for the Triple pilot. Paste into backbone/tools.conf (user-only; adopt doesn't write it).
# Patterns cover both server names in use (linear, linear-triple). Reads run; every write needs the user
# (supervised: Claude Code asks; autonomous: refused). merge_diff is refused outright under HARNESS_PROFILE=triple.
mcp__linear*__get_*            read
mcp__linear*__list_*           read
mcp__linear*__search_*         read
mcp__linear*__extract_images   read
mcp__linear*__whoami           read
mcp__linear*__save_comment     network   confirm
mcp__linear*__save_issue       network   confirm
mcp__linear*__create_*         network   confirm
mcp__linear*__delete_*         network   confirm
mcp__linear*__save_*           network   confirm
mcp__linear*__merge_diff       network   confirm
